msgid "The Gaze daemon is not running yet. Its first start downloads face models, which can take a few minutes. This page updates when it is ready."
msgstr "Layanan Gaze belum berjalan. Saat pertama kali dimulai, model wajah akan diunduh, yang dapat memakan waktu beberapa menit. Halaman ini akan diperbarui setelah siap."

msgid "Face the camera"
msgstr "Hadapkan wajah ke kamera"

msgid "Tilt your face slightly up"
msgstr "Miringkan wajah Anda sedikit ke atas"

msgid "Tilt your face slightly down"
msgstr "Miringkan wajah Anda sedikit ke bawah"

msgid "Turn your face slightly left"
msgstr "Putar wajah Anda sedikit ke kiri"

msgid "Turn your face slightly right"
msgstr "Putar wajah Anda sedikit ke kanan"

msgid "Captured"
msgstr "Gambar diambil"

msgid "Enrollment complete"
msgstr "Pendaftaran selesai"

msgid "Enrollment cancelled"
msgstr "Pendaftaran dibatalkan"

msgid "Database error during enrollment"
msgstr "Kesalahan basis data saat pendaftaran"

msgid "Camera error during enrollment"
msgstr "Kesalahan kamera saat pendaftaran"

msgid "Please look at the camera..."
msgstr "Silakan lihat ke kamera…"

msgid "Need more light..."
msgstr "Perlu lebih banyak cahaya…"

msgid "Face is clipped. Please move back..."
msgstr "Wajah terpotong. Silakan mundur…"

msgid "Please center your face..."
msgstr "Posisikan wajah Anda di tengah…"

msgid "Please come closer..."
msgstr "Silakan mendekat…"

msgid "Please back up..."
msgstr "Silakan mundur…"

msgid "Hold still..."
msgstr "Jangan bergerak…"

msgid "Face authentication could not run"
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah tidak dapat dijalankan"

msgid "Face not recognized"
msgstr "Wajah tidak dikenali"

msgid "Too dark for face authentication"
msgstr "Terlalu gelap untuk autentikasi wajah"

msgid "No face detected"
msgstr "Tidak ada wajah yang terdeteksi"

msgid "Move your face into the frame and try again"
msgstr "Posisikan wajah Anda di dalam bingkai lalu coba lagi"

msgid "Starting enrollment…"
msgstr "Memulai pendaftaran…"

msgid "Enrollment finished without saving."
msgstr "Pendaftaran selesai tanpa menyimpan."

msgid "%1 [%2s]"
msgstr "%1 [%2s]"

msgid "Could not restart the Gaze service (%1)"
msgstr "Tidak dapat memulai ulang layanan Gaze (%1)"

msgid "The Gaze service did not start again after the restart"
msgstr "Layanan Gaze tidak berjalan lagi setelah dimulai ulang"

msgid "Re-enroll faces after this change?"
msgstr "Daftarkan ulang wajah setelah perubahan ini?"

msgid "Existing captures cannot match with the new recognition model. They remain on disk. After saving, use Improve this face for each profile, then test recognition."
msgstr "Hasil pengambilan gambar yang ada tidak cocok dengan model pengenalan baru. Data tetap tersimpan di disk. Setelah menyimpan, gunakan “Sempurnakan wajah ini” untuk setiap profil, lalu uji pengenalan."

msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Standar"

msgid "Accurate"
msgstr "Akurat"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Everyday settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan umum"

msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan lanjutan"

msgid "Restart Service"
msgstr "Mulai Ulang Layanan"

msgid "Settings are locked"
msgstr "Pengaturan terkunci"

msgid "Unlock…"
msgstr "Buka kunci…"

msgid "Settings saved. Restart the Gaze service to use the new inference provider."
msgstr "Pengaturan disimpan. Mulai ulang layanan Gaze untuk memakai penyedia inferensi yang baru."

msgid "Restarting the Gaze service…"
msgstr "Memulai ulang layanan Gaze…"

msgid "Gaze service restarted"
msgstr "Layanan Gaze dimulai ulang"

msgid "Restarting the Gaze service failed"
msgstr "Gagal memulai ulang layanan Gaze"

msgid "Security"
msgstr "Keamanan"

msgid "Security level"
msgstr "Tingkat keamanan"

msgid "Medium is recommended. Changing the recognition model requires new captures for existing profiles"
msgstr "Sedang disarankan. Mengubah model pengenalan memerlukan pengambilan gambar baru untuk profil yang ada"

msgid "Low"
msgstr "Rendah"

msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Sedang"

msgid "High"
msgstr "Tinggi"

msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Maksimum"

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Khusus"

msgid "Detector level"
msgstr "Tingkat pendeteksi"

msgid "Recognizer level"
msgstr "Tingkat pengenal"

msgid "RGB recognizer threshold"
msgstr "Ambang pengenal RGB"

msgid "Minimum RGB similarity for a match"
msgstr "Kemiripan RGB minimum agar dianggap cocok"

msgid "IR recognizer threshold"
msgstr "Ambang pengenal IR"

msgid "Minimum IR similarity for a match"
msgstr "Kemiripan IR minimum agar dianggap cocok"

msgid "Hybrid combining policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan kombinasi hibrida"

msgid "Combining policy when both RGB and IR cameras are active"
msgstr "Kebijakan kombinasi saat kamera RGB dan IR sama-sama aktif"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Bawaan"

msgid "Or"
msgstr "Atau"

msgid "Fallback on dark"
msgstr "Beralih saat gelap"

msgid "And"
msgstr "Dan"

msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Perangkat keras"

msgid "Inference execution provider"
msgstr "Penyedia eksekusi inferensi"

msgid "CPU, automatic NPU, Intel OpenVINO, or AMD Ryzen AI"
msgstr "CPU, NPU otomatis, Intel OpenVINO, atau AMD Ryzen AI"

msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

msgid "Automatic (NPU)"
msgstr "Otomatis (NPU)"

msgid "Intel OpenVINO"
msgstr "Intel OpenVINO"

msgid "AMD Ryzen AI"
msgstr "AMD Ryzen AI"

msgid "OpenVINO inference device"
msgstr "Perangkat inferensi OpenVINO"

msgid "The Intel device used for all ONNX models"
msgstr "Perangkat Intel yang dipakai untuk semua model ONNX"

msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

msgid "NPU"
msgstr "NPU"

msgid "RGB camera source"
msgstr "Sumber kamera RGB"

msgid "Primary camera"
msgstr "Kamera utama"

msgid "None (IR only)"
msgstr "Tidak ada (hanya IR)"

msgid "IR camera source"
msgstr "Sumber kamera IR"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "IR frame size override"
msgstr "Paksa ukuran bingkai IR"

msgid "Force one resolution if the IR feed is green or corrupted on auto"
msgstr "Paksa satu resolusi jika gambar IR berwarna hijau atau rusak pada mode otomatis"

msgid "Width"
msgstr "Lebar"

msgid "Height"
msgstr "Tinggi"

msgid "Force IR emitter"
msgstr "Paksa pemancar IR"

msgid "Override emitter control, only if the IR emitter stays off on its own"
msgstr "Ganti kendali pemancar, hanya jika pemancar IR tidak menyala sendiri"

msgid "Parallel RGB + IR capture"
msgstr "Pengambilan RGB + IR paralel"

msgid "Faster hybrid authentication, but some webcams cannot stream both sensors at once"
msgstr "Autentikasi hibrida lebih cepat, tetapi beberapa webcam tidak dapat menjalankan kedua sensor sekaligus"

msgid "Never (capture RGB, then IR)"
msgstr "Tidak pernah (ambil RGB, lalu IR)"

msgid "Auto (parallel when the camera allows it)"
msgstr "Otomatis (paralel jika kamera mendukung)"

msgid "Always (capture RGB and IR at once)"
msgstr "Selalu (ambil RGB dan IR sekaligus)"

msgid "Darkness cutoff"
msgstr "Batas kegelapan"

msgid "Reject frames below this mean brightness (0–255)"
msgstr "Tolak bingkai di bawah kecerahan rata-rata ini (0–255)"

msgid "Enrollment"
msgstr "Pendaftaran"

msgid "Maximum templates"
msgstr "Templat maksimum"

msgid "Number of capture sets stored per face"
msgstr "Jumlah set pengambilan gambar yang disimpan per wajah"

msgid "Minimum face size ratio"
msgstr "Rasio ukuran wajah minimum"

msgid "Smallest accepted face during enrollment; lower allows more distance"
msgstr "Wajah terkecil yang diterima saat pendaftaran; nilai lebih rendah memungkinkan jarak lebih jauh"

msgid "Liveness Anti-Spoofing"
msgstr "Deteksi Liveness Anti-Pemalsuan"

msgid "Enable liveness spoof prevention"
msgstr "Aktifkan pencegahan pemalsuan dengan deteksi liveness"

msgid "Check camera images and natural movement for signs of a photo or screen"
msgstr "Periksa gambar kamera dan gerakan alami untuk mencari tanda-tanda foto atau layar"

msgid "Liveness threshold"
msgstr "Ambang deteksi liveness"

msgid "Minimum spoof prevention confidence"
msgstr "Keyakinan minimum pencegahan pemalsuan"

msgid "Maximum liveness duration"
msgstr "Durasi maksimum deteksi liveness"

msgid "Maximum seconds analyzed for liveness verification"
msgstr "Jumlah detik maksimum yang dianalisis untuk deteksi liveness"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi"

msgid "Abort if SSH"
msgstr "Batalkan jika SSH"

msgid "Prevent authentication over SSH connections"
msgstr "Cegah autentikasi melalui koneksi SSH"

msgid "Abort if lid closed"
msgstr "Batalkan jika penutup tertutup"

msgid "Prevent authentication when the laptop lid is closed"
msgstr "Cegah autentikasi saat penutup laptop tertutup"

msgid "Require a suspend first"
msgstr "Wajibkan suspensi terlebih dahulu"

msgid "Prevent authentication until the system has suspended and resumed once"
msgstr "Cegah autentikasi sampai sistem pernah disuspensi dan dilanjutkan satu kali"

msgid "Require confirmation on lock screen"
msgstr "Wajibkan konfirmasi di layar kunci"

msgid "On KDE lock/login screens this requires your password instead of face unlock. Confirmation after a match is available on other supported surfaces"
msgstr "Pada layar kunci/login KDE, opsi ini mewajibkan kata sandi sebagai pengganti buka kunci wajah. Konfirmasi setelah wajah cocok tersedia di tempat lain yang didukung"

msgid "Require confirmation for elevated authentication"
msgstr "Wajibkan konfirmasi untuk autentikasi dengan hak istimewa"

msgid "Require pressing Enter or clicking OK to authorize after face matches for sudo, polkit, and similar prompts"
msgstr "Wajibkan menekan Enter atau mengeklik OK untuk mengizinkan setelah wajah cocok pada sudo, polkit, dan permintaan serupa"

msgid "Resume grace period (ms)"
msgstr "Masa tenggang setelah dilanjutkan (ms)"

msgid "Delay face authentication on wake from suspend"
msgstr "Tunda autentikasi wajah saat bangun dari suspensi"

msgid "Start delay (ms)"
msgstr "Penundaan awal (ms)"

msgid "Use 3000–5000 ms to give yourself time to step away after locking"
msgstr "Gunakan 3000–5000 ms agar Anda sempat menjauh setelah mengunci"

msgid "Start delay applies to"
msgstr "Penundaan awal berlaku untuk"

msgid "Which prompts wait for the start delay"
msgstr "Permintaan mana yang menunggu penundaan awal"

msgid "All face authentication (including sudo)"
msgstr "Semua autentikasi wajah (termasuk sudo)"

msgid "Screen lockers only"
msgstr "Hanya pengunci layar"

msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Penyimpanan"

msgid "Encrypt face templates"
msgstr "Enkripsi templat wajah"

msgid "Encrypt face templates at rest with a TPM-sealed key"
msgstr "Enkripsi templat wajah yang disimpan dengan kunci yang disegel TPM"

msgid "Unlock GNOME Keyring"
msgstr "Buka kunci GNOME Keyring"

msgid "Use an enrolled password after liveness-protected GDM or greetd face login"
msgstr "Gunakan kata sandi terdaftar setelah login wajah GDM atau greetd yang dilindungi deteksi liveness"

msgid "Unlock KWallet"
msgstr "Buka kunci KWallet"

msgid "Use an enrolled password after liveness-protected KDE login; enroll with gaze keyring --kwallet"
msgstr "Gunakan kata sandi terdaftar setelah login KDE yang dilindungi deteksi liveness; daftarkan dengan gaze keyring --kwallet"

msgid "Enrolled Faces"
msgstr "Wajah Terdaftar"

msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

msgid "Configure Gaze"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Gaze"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "Uji"

msgid "Test face authentication"
msgstr "Uji autentikasi wajah"

msgid "Add Face…"
msgstr "Tambah Wajah…"

msgid "Enroll a new face"
msgstr "Daftarkan wajah baru"

msgid "Faces enrolled for %1"
msgstr "Wajah yang terdaftar untuk %1"

msgid "Look at the camera…"
msgstr "Lihat ke kamera…"

msgid "Face recognized"
msgstr "Wajah dikenali"

msgid "No face seen before the test timed out"
msgstr "Tidak ada wajah terlihat sebelum waktu uji habis"

msgid "No Faces Enrolled"
msgstr "Belum Ada Wajah Terdaftar"

msgid "Enroll a face to get started"
msgstr "Daftarkan wajah untuk memulai"

